[160.336988, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KNow I'll run both, save outputs, and diff.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;203m\u2717 \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(Error: Blocked: unquoted redirect operators det...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;203m\u2717 \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(Error: Blocked: unquoted redirect operators det...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[KLet me run them capturing output directly, then write the files.\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(100 Continue) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(100 Continue) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[KBoth produce identical output. Now let me save the outputs to files and diff them. I'll use Python\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kto write files (avoiding the blocked shell redirects).\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[15G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u001b[39m\u001b[2mDIFF LINES: 0) 0.1s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(diff exit code: 0) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KDone. Both files are created, run, and their outputs are byte-for-byte identical (181 bytes each,\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kdiff exit code 0).\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mSide-by-side outputs\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K|\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;75m\u2191 80 above \u00b7 \u2193 1 below \u00b7 Shift+\u2191\u2193 \u00b7 End \u2913\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;35mCreate a file called nested.p\u2026\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2